{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Preserve the invocation-end hook when failure serialization throws.** `finishInvocation()` now calls `buildErrorObject()` before `fireOnInvocationEnd()`. If a custom `SerDes` rejects the handler exception, execution exits without the matching lifecycle hook; the added `failureSerializationStillFiresInvocationEnd` test consequently fails. Fire the FAILED hook with the original handler error before building the output, or guarantee it through a `finally` path.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7-B5TH","finding_digest":"c9c5a836e63f7b6a1d54f6609382f2c7f6173d220217718a57fb5e4d013519f7","finding_id":"arf_v1_zhc2qnxgh55wuhku6zqjhaxsy7","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::finishinvocation::invocation-end-on-failure-serialization","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::finishinvocation::invocation-end-on-failure-serialization","line":165,"observation_digest":"8bd47a84b479e738b132be2c27e62e30710b245f93fc0c1942fe739598a1808a","observation_id":"aro_v1_rpkhvbfuphttrmjsxywcpzrogb","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-13T17:31:01Z","review_id":"arr_v1_ffjxzemgtsu4nxvuadis2ybagc","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"2c313b2a78321d70492785d77d5559aba562d50c","reviewer":"codex","start_line":165,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":778},"record_id":"art_v1_xrujch2eenyvh723qbvj2ixz6j","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-13T17:31:01Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
